These files have been moved to `spl/Program/SuperCollider/Scheduler`.

They are obsolete and are deleted here.

Notes:

Simple _program_ files require an editor command to bracket the program text as _{ ... }.fork_ (c.f. stc-fork-region in Emacs)

Sclang requires synthesis graphs to be written in enclosing functions, stsc3 does not.
If programs are to be compatible they should follow the sclang rule.

There are _texture_ forms of these graphs at _../texture_.

~~~sh
for i in *.stc ; do stsc3 translate stc sc < $i ; done
~~~
